==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|по-|е́хать}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|пое́хать}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-поехать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|пое́хать|pf|impf=е́хать}}

# to [[go]] ''(in a conveyance or on horseback)''
# to [[ride]], to [[drive]]
#: {{ux|ru|'''пое́хать''' [[за]] [[го́род]]|to go to the suburbs of a city by driving (suburbs are described as something "behind" a city)}}
# to [[travel]]
#: {{ux|ru|[[я|Я]] '''пое́ду''' [[на]] [[почта|по́чту]].|I'm going to go to the post office.|q=unidirectional}}
# {{lb|ru|figurative}} to [[go mad]]/[[insane]], to [[lose one's mind]]
#: {{syn|ru|свихну́ться|чо́кнуться|сойти́ с ума́}}

====Usage notes====
* {{U:sla:directional verb|ru|uni|impf=е́хать|pf=пое́хать|other=е́здить}}

